      "id": "claim_1549c5f477d8476fa2aa35aeef1830f9",
      "statement": "The repository fixes observer strategies per resource type (docs/observers.md §9.2): GitHub repo/Google docs-sheets-selected-calendar/Linear teams/Notion pages/Supabase projects use the single-unit ACL check (B); broad bindings with distinct sub-resource ACLs and a per-observer oracle (BigQuery, Linear workspace, Notion workspace, Supabase org, Confluence, Context Library, allVisible calendars) use data-set tracking (C); Gmail mailbox and ZoomInfo are private-only (A); Spotify/email/Home Assistant are low-stakes no-ops (D); Cloudflare exposes no resources (N/A) — and a broad binding uses C only when both distinct ACLs and an access oracle exist.",
