      "statement": "mcp-shared is a shared library (not a Worker) behind gatekeeper-mcp and gatekeeper-mcp-portal, holding code where two copies would eventually disagree in a security-relevant way: tool classification, the scope grammar, the OAuth lifecycle, and approval-queue wiring; the two connectors differ only in where the endpoint comes from (user-pasted URL vs the admin-configured MCP_PORTAL_URL).",
